OL,3,AFeminist activist and journalist Gloria
OL,4,ASteinem dies, aged 92
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloria Steinem, who became a face of
OL,7,Fthe women's liberation movement in the
OL,8,FUS, has died, aged 92.
OL,10,FIn a post on Instagram, her foundation
OL,11,Fsaid she "passed away peacefully" at
OL,12,Fher home in New York City on Wednesday,
OL,13,F"surrounded by many who loved her".
OL,15,FSteinem, who was a writer and magazine
OL,16,Feditor, co-founded the Women's Action
OL,17,FAlliance - a group dedicated to
OL,18,Ffighting sexism - more than 50 years
OL,19,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
