OL,3,AFeminist activist and journalist Gloria
OL,4,ASteinem dies, aged 92
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe started her career as a journalist
OL,7,Fin New York and went on to co-found Ms.
OL,8,Fmagazine, one of the first publications
OL,9,Fto focus on women's issues other than
OL,10,Fhousekeeping and beauty.
